Training ≈ 28.2 + 31.4 + 27.4 ≈ 87 GPU-h (measured unseen-protocol wall times; +24 updates), evaluations ≈ 5.3 GPU-h, probes/validation/finalisation ≈ 2 GPU-h: ≈ 94 GPU-h before contingency; the certified probe projections replace these estimates at launch. GPU availability (as of 2026-09-15 10:30): GPU 0 busy with exp_05 L_simple until ≈ 2026-09-16 23:30 then exp_05 evaluations until ≈ 2026-09-17 08:00; GPU 1 busy with exp_05 L_cylindrical until ≈ 2026-09-16 10:00, its evaluations until ≈ 13:00, then promised to exp_06 (its plan budgets ≈ 42 GPU-h with ≈ 50 reserved: pretraining + HAA). Two orderings, both finishing before the 2026-09-24 deadline:
